/Title (I will first give an update on the fast protein structure search tool Foldseek2, including a new 12-state alphabet complementary to 3D. Whereas the focus in developing Foldseek was on speed, the goal in developing LoL-align was to attain maximum accuracy alignments and homology detection sensitivity.  Finally, changing topics, I will describe our efforts to support computational and experimental immunologists with a toolkit for modeling peptide-MHC complexes, predicting binding to arbitrary MHC alleles, and designing peptide antigens, for instance for improved  cancer vaccines.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2628 0 R
/Prev 2632 0 R
>>
